The Cabinet of Shadows — Dual License
======================================

The software (the code that builds and runs the site) and the content
(the editorial prose, the alienist's voice, translations, and curated
bibliography) are licensed separately.

This was a deliberate choice. We wanted the engineering work to be as
freely reusable as possible, while keeping the editorial voice from
being lifted wholesale into other projects without attribution and
without preserving its non-commercial spirit.


