2. CONTENT LICENSE — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

The editorial content in this repository — specifically:

  • the alienist's prose in every monster dossier
    (legend, anxiety, clinical note, diagnosis)
  • the introductory and framing essays
    (the home page lede, /the-alienist, /sources lede)
  • the Thai translations of the above
  • the curated bibliography selection and arrangement
    (the underlying papers are themselves the work of their authors)
  • the editorial voice, terminology, and structural conceit

is released under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.

